---
---
<section class="section section--light" id="planos">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="eyebrow">Planos</span>
      <h2>Descubra qual é o melhor produto para você.</h2>
      <p>Assine por 12 meses e fique tranquilo — ou fale com um especialista para encontrar o plano ideal.</p>
      <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
        <a href="#" class="btn btn--whatsapp">
          <svg width="26" height="26" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M17.5 14.4c-.3-.1-1.7-.8-2-.9-.3-.1-.5-.1-.7.1-.2.3-.7.9-.9 1.1-.2.2-.3.2-.6.1-.3-.1-1.2-.5-2.2-1.4-.8-.7-1.4-1.6-1.5-1.9-.2-.3 0-.4.1-.6.1-.1.3-.3.4-.5.1-.2.2-.3.3-.5.1-.2 0-.4 0-.5 0-.1-.7-1.6-.9-2.2-.2-.6-.5-.5-.7-.5h-.6c-.2 0-.5.1-.8.4s-1 1-1 2.4 1 2.8 1.2 3c.2.2 2.1 3.2 5.2 4.5.7.3 1.3.5 1.7.6.7.2 1.4.2 1.9.1.6-.1 1.7-.7 2-1.4.2-.7.2-1.2.2-1.4 0-.2-.3-.3-.6-.5zM12 2C6.5 2 2 6.5 2 12c0 1.8.5 3.5 1.3 5L2 22l5.2-1.4c1.4.8 3.1 1.2 4.8 1.2 5.5 0 10-4.5 10-10S17.5 2 12 2z"/></svg>
          Falar com Especialista
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="plans">
      <!-- Plan B3 (featured) -->
      <article class="plan plan--featured">
        <span class="plan__tag">Mais popular</span>
        <div class="plan__head">
          <div class="plan__flag">🇧🇷</div>
          <div>
            <div class="plan__title">Assinatura B3</div>
            <div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-top: 2px;">Bolsa de Valores · Ações, FIIs, ETFs, opções</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="plan__sub">12 meses de cálculo de IR para investimentos na Bolsa brasileira.</p>
        <div class="plan__price">
          <span class="currency">R$</span>
          <span class="amount">22</span>
          <span class="cents">,90</span>
          <span class="period">/mês</span>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            12 meses de cálculo de IR
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Relatório de auxílio para a declaração anual
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Múltiplos relatórios de resultado
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Geração de DARF com juros e multas
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Sem limite de corretoras, operações ou valor investido
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Relatórios para revisão contábil simplificada
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn--primary">Contratar agora</a>
      </article>

      <!-- Plan Exterior -->
      <article class="plan">
        <div class="plan__head">
          <div class="plan__flag">🇺🇸</div>
          <div>
            <div class="plan__title">Assinatura Exterior</div>
            <div style="font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--fg-muted); margin-top: 2px;">Investimentos fora do Brasil</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="plan__sub">12 meses de cálculo de IR para investimentos no Exterior.</p>
        <div class="plan__price">
          <span class="currency">R$</span>
          <span class="amount">29</span>
          <span class="cents">,90</span>
          <span class="period">/mês</span>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            12 meses de cálculo do IR para investimentos no Exterior
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Conversão automática de câmbio (PTAX)
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Cálculo conforme a Lei 14.754/23
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Relatórios exclusivos de acompanhamento
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="check"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
            Compatibilidade com Avenue, Nomad, IBKR e mais
          </li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#" class="btn btn--secondary">Contratar agora</a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <!-- Extras bar -->
    <div class="plan-extras">
      <div class="item">
        <span class="check"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
        <div>
          <b>Atendimento especializado</b><br />
          <span style="color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 13px;">Analistas focados em renda variável.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <span class="check"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
        <div>
          <b>Suporte para todos os produtos</b><br />
          <span style="color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 13px;">Da importação ao DARF — em todos os planos.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="item">
        <span class="check"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg></span>
        <div>
          <b>Profissional para tirar dúvidas</b><br />
          <span style="color: var(--fg-muted); font-size: 13px;">Fale com um especialista quando precisar.</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
